{"unit_id":"lium970320__dsh-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"lium970320/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"5bdf772608d98c012507bf686f14dd15a886c657","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 是一个面向 DSH web 的视觉桥接插件，为无法直接处理图片的主模型提供看图能力。它向 DSH 注册 view_image 工具，并通过 pi-ai 适配器补丁把会话图片交给配置的视觉模型转换成文字，再交给主模型。用户可以让模型分析本地图片、HTTP(S) 图片或 data URL，也可针对图片提出具体问题；插件会返回视觉模型生成的描述。需要配置视觉接口地址和模型，可通过环境变量或本地配置提供密钥；图片内容会发送到所配置的视觉接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/dsh-view-image.js:145-220","plugin/apply-vision-patch.js:15-50"]}
{"unit_id":"lium970320__dsh-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"lium970320/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"5bdf772608d98c012507bf686f14dd15a886c657","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-bridge adds image understanding to DSH web. It registers view_image and patches pi-ai to convert session images into text for the main model. It accepts local paths, URLs, and data URLs. Configure a vision endpoint and model, plus an optional API key. Images are sent to that endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/dsh-view-image.js:145-220","plugin/apply-vision-patch.js:15-50"]}
